# Agent allocation

This repo uses **two roles**. Pick the role that matches this chat (user will say, or enable the matching rule).

| Role | This chat | Output |
|------|-----------|--------|
| **Design agent** | Product, UX, metrics meaning, priorities, trade-offs | Decisions + **work orders** in `docs/AGENT_HANDOFF_*.md` |
| **Programming agent** | Implement, test, fix CI, commit code | Code + `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_NOTES_*.md` when done |

**Handoff is the contract.** Design agent does not need to implement large features here; programming agent implements from handoffs.

- Backlog index: `docs/AGENT_HANDOFF_INDEX.md` (design maintains; programming executes in order unless user reprioritizes)
- Architecture baseline: `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`
- User writes in English; UI copy default **English** (see latest handoffs)

Do not edit `.cursor/plans/*.plan.md` unless the user asks.
